  "report": "On October 8, 2026, City Wire reported a possible transfer interest between Cedar United and Northbridge involving striker Alex Stone. The correction clarified that no formal offer, signed contract, or agreed transfer fee had been confirmed. Cedar United stated it had not agreed a fee and made no formal offer, while the club’s spokesperson noted preliminary discussion with Stone’s agent on October 7. Northbridge had no comment. No transfer was finalized or verified. The correction followed initial reporting that implied an agreed fee, which City Wire withdrew. Club Bulletin corroborated Cedar’s position, confirming only a preliminary conversation occurred and no fee was agreed. All parties remain in their current registrations and no move has been confirmed."

